 upgrade system!","detailedDescription":"Geometry Arena is a free-form arena-shooter Roguelite with heavy emphasis on building an overpowered character. \n\nKey Features\n\n• \n12 classes with unique mechanics \n\n• \n12 color variations that bring ability changes \n\n• \n75 skill modules\n\n• \n28 difficulty options which allow you to DIY your game\n\n• \n18 difficulty levels to suit the real needs of each player\n\n• \n20+ bullet variations and splits that stack up perfectly\n\n• \n160+ upgrades that can be mixed and matched\n\n• \n5 levels of adjustable light effects\n\n• \nA fun and rewarding character development process\n\n• \nLimitless rune upgrade system\n\n• \nHardcore character attribute system\n\n• \nNumerous but destructible enemy projectiles\n\n• \nTense and exciting arena battles\n\n• \nEndless Mode with its leaderboard\n\nSummarize  \n\n• \nVariety, Freedom, and Infinity are the core pillars of the Geometry Arena series. \n\n• \nHere, you can personally create the game experience that suits you best, immerse yourself in it, and create hours of wonderful memories. \n\n• \nWishing you an enjoyable experience!","aboutGame":null},"vi":{"status":"pending_translation","provider":null,"shortDescription":null,"detailedDescription":null,"aboutGame":null}},"media":{"images":[{"role":"header","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1255650/header.jpg?t=1779546689"},{"role":"capsule","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1255650/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1779546689"}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1255650/ss_1f64868fce92c5835a04d4261942b84813b7a10b.600x338.jpg?t=1779546689","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1255650/ss_1f64868fce92c5835a04d4261942b84813b7a10b.1920x1080.jpg?t=1779546689"},{"id":1,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1255650/s